**10. Next Step: Data Source Audit**

With ground truth established, the next systematic step is a complete
audit of all data sources required to build the mCRPC disease net and
run ODE simulations. This includes:

**Genomic data:** TCGA-PRAD, SU2C-mCRPC (Robinson et al. 2015), COSMIC
mutations

**Transcriptomic data:** scRNA-seq datasets for prostate cancer with
treatment-naïve and treatment-resistant populations

**Drug sensitivity data:** GDSC (286 drugs, 941 cell lines), CCLE,
BeatAML for cross-disease validation

**PK/PD parameters:** Docetaxel, abiraterone, olaparib, talazoparib,
enzalutamide --- published pharmacokinetic data

**Pathway databases:** KEGG, Reactome, STRING v12 for AR signaling, DNA
repair, EMT pathways

**Protein structures:** AlphaFold DB for target proteins (AR, CYP17A1,
PARP1/2, BRCA2)

This audit will be documented in the next specification:
INTERCEPTA_Phase1_DataSource_Audit_v1.0.docx

